WEBVTT

00:03:24.999 --> 00:03:30.281
unless we recognize the other half.

00:03:30.281 --> 00:03:34.592
I suggest that real equality,

00:03:34.592 --> 00:03:36.863
full equality,

00:03:36.863 --> 00:03:40.078
does not just mean valuing women

00:03:40.078 --> 00:03:42.245
on male terms.

00:03:42.245 --> 00:03:46.863
It means creating a much wider range

00:03:46.863 --> 00:03:50.875
of equally respected choices

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:53.926
for women and for men.

00:03:53.926 --> 00:03:57.395
And to get there, we have to change our workplaces,

00:03:57.395 --> 00:04:00.309
our policies and our culture.